---
flowchart TB
    subgraph CLIENT[Untrusted client]
        WEB[Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind<br/>Login - Chat - Documents - Admin]
    end

    subgraph IDENTITY[Identity service]
        AUTH[Supabase Auth<br/>Accounts and signed tokens]
    end

    subgraph SERVER[Trusted application processes - Node.js]
        API[NestJS API<br/>Verify token and current membership<br/>Document ACLs - private history - quota]
        FINAL[Final transaction<br/>Recheck all potential sources and attempt fence<br/>Save answer + provenance + usage atomically]
        RELAY[Outbox publisher + reconciler<br/>Repair pending dispatch and abandoned work]
        WORKER[BullMQ worker<br/>Validate extraction - chunk - embed<br/>Fenced activation and purge]
        API --> FINAL
    end

    subgraph DATA[Private data services - separate runtime roles]
        PG[(PostgreSQL + pgvector<br/>Relational constraints - forced RLS<br/>Jobs - outbox - provenance - quota - audit)]
        REDIS[(Redis + BullMQ<br/>Job IDs - bounded retries<br/>Delivery may repeat)]
        STORAGE[(Private Supabase Storage<br/>Opaque original-file objects<br/>No ordinary-user direct access)]
    end

    subgraph PROVIDERS[External data processors]
        EMBED[Configurable embedding provider<br/>Document chunks and question vectors]
        ANSWER[Configurable answer provider<br/>Question + freshly authorized context<br/>No database or storage tools]
    end

    WEB <-->|Login and session| AUTH
    AUTH -.->|Trusted signing keys / verification| API
    WEB <-->|Bearer token - validated API requests| API
    API -->|Current ACL-filtered retrieval| PG
    FINAL -->|Short locked commit before response| PG
    API <-->|Backend-authenticated upload / download| STORAGE
    API -->|Durable version + job + outbox| PG
    PG -->|Pending dispatch / recovery candidates| RELAY
    RELAY -->|Job UUID only| REDIS
    REDIS -->|At-least-once delivery| WORKER
    WORKER <-->|Lease / chunks / activation / purge state| PG
    WORKER <-->|Read original / purge after tombstone| STORAGE
    WORKER -->|Embedding request outside transaction| EMBED
    API -->|Question embedding| EMBED
    API -->|Pre-dispatch source access check| ANSWER
    ANSWER -->|Untrusted answer and citation labels| FINAL

    NOTE[Design only - no service implemented<br/>Browser controls and model prompts do not authorize access<br/>DB authorization precedes network delivery; delivered data cannot be recalled]
    FINAL -.-> NOTE

